{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnClosureLift","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnClosureLift","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnClosure","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnLift"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_closeD_eq_ptr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_closeD_eq_ptr","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L89-L96","doc":"**Trace compatibility of the lift.**  The image under `glnFunctor` of the closure of the\nleftmost strand computed in `OS(q, qi, q^n, [n]_q)` is `qi^n` times the weighted quantum partial\ntrace `ptr` of `GLnTrace`, applied to the image of the morphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_closeD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_closeD","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L77-L87","doc":"**The lift carries the `OS` closure to the `GL_n` datum's closure.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_η","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_η","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L75-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_ε","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_ε","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_δ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_δ","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L72-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_μ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.G_μ","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L69-L71","doc":"The tensorator of `glnFunctor` is the canonical `OS.μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.map_closeL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.map_closeL","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L52-L58","doc":"A monoidal functor carries a cup–whisker–cap closure to the closure of the images. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.map_capL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.map_capL","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L44-L50","doc":"A monoidal functor carries a cap on the left of `Y` to the cap of the image. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.map_cupL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.map_cupL","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosureLift.lean#L37-L42","do